/-!
# Certified actions of the published Sylow and representative words

Signed original-generator letters are linked to the actual quotient units.
Kernel-checked row traces evaluate all four generator matrices and the two
rows needed for each of the 110 representative roots. Checking intermediate
values prevents repeated normalization of long nested matrix expressions.
The fixed subgroup consequently stabilizes the unordered pair {2148, 2163}.

Word and matrix provenance is unchanged from the imported Words module;
source/generate.py reproduces the traces in source/word_traces.json.
-/

